{
  "id": 936,
  "title": "Be late again",
  "russian_title": "Опять опоздал",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "torfl_level": "A2",
  "hsk_tags": [
    "A2"
  ],
  "slug": "be-late-again",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/936_be-late-again.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I met Yang Chen at school in September 2017. He’s my classmate. He takes a taxi to school every day, while I walk. There’s a lot of traffic every day, so he’s often late. This year, we went to Shanghai on a trip. He flew, and I took the train. The weather was bad, so his flight was delayed, and he was late again."
  ],
  "english_full": "I met Yang Chen at school in September 2017. He’s my classmate. He takes a taxi to school every day, while I walk. There’s a lot of traffic every day, so he’s often late. This year, we went to Shanghai on a trip. He flew, and I took the train. The weather was bad, so his flight was delayed, and he was late again.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Я встре́тил Я́нга Че́на в шко́ле в сентя́бре 2017 го́да. Он мой однокла́ссник. Он берёт такси́ в шко́лу ка́ждый день, пока́ я иду пешко́м. Там мно́го движе́ния ка́ждый день, поэ́тому он ча́сто опозда́ет. В э́том году́ мы съезди́ли в Шанха́й в пое́здку. Он летел на самолёте, а я поехал на по́езде. Погода́ была́ пло́хая, и его́ полёт заде́ржали, поэ́тому он опозда́л опя́ть."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ya vstrétil Yánga Chéna v shkóle v sentyábre 2017 góda. On moy odnoklássnik. On berët taksí v shkólu kázhdy den', poká ya idu peshkóm. Tam mnógo dvizhéniya kázhdy den', poé tomu on chásto opozdáet. V étom godú my s'yezdili v Shanháy v poézdku. On letel na samolyóte, a ya poéhal na póyezde. Pogodá bylá plokháya, i egó polyót zaderzhali, poé tomu on opozdál opýat'."
  ],
